# Compiled binary from local `go build`/`go run` (e.g. via a containerized
# toolchain bind-mounted into this directory for a quick compile check) —
# accidentally committing this breaks ArgoCD's Helm templating: it exceeds
# Helm's 5MB per-file chart limit and gets picked up as a chart "file"
# since it sits inside this Helm chart's directory tree.
/server
